{"title":"MacOS、Linux安装通过国内镜像安装zsh和oh my zsh","date":"2023-09-12T19:25:15.000Z","source":"_posts/MacOS、Linux安装通过国内镜像安装zsh和oh my zsh.md","raw":"---\ntitle: MacOS、Linux安装通过国内镜像安装zsh和oh my zsh\ncategories: [RD]\ndate: 2023/9/12 19:25:15\n\n---\n1. 通过软件包管理brew等安装zsh\n2. 设置zsh为默认shell\n\n```plain\nchsh -s $(which zsh)\n```\n\n3. 通过清华tuna镜像站获取oh my zsh 的git仓库地址\n\n```shell\nhttps://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/help/ohmyzsh.git/\n\ngit clone https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/git/ohmyzsh.git\ncd ohmyzsh/tools\n\n修改\nREPO=${REPO:-ohmyzsh}\nREMOTE=${REMOTE:-https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/git/${REPO}.git}\n\nREMOTE=https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/git/ohmyzsh.git sh install.sh\n```\n\n3. 安装后进入～/.zshrc进行主题、插件配置\n\n```shell\ngit clone --depth=1 https://gitee.com/romkatv/powerlevel10k.git ${ZSH_CUSTOM:-$HOME/.oh-my-zsh/custom}/themes/powerlevel10k\nvim .zshrc\n\nZSH_THEME=\"powerlevel10k/powerlevel10k\"\n\n```\n\n\n\n","slug":"MacOS、Linux安装通过国内镜像安装zsh和oh my zsh","published":true,"updated":"2026-05-25T03:07:12.252Z","_id":"cuidrw9Ufik5oSQ5Ujqrj86oV","comments":true,"layout":"post","photos":[],"html":"<ol>\n<li>通过软件包管理brew等安装zsh</li>\n<li>设置zsh为默认shell</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">chsh -s $(which zsh)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li>通过清华tuna镜像站获取oh my zsh 的git仓库地址</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">https://mirrors.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/help/ohmyzsh.git/</span><